ol-r2\", \"title\": \"NaN in id tie-break half restores permutation-dependence\", \"severity\": \"minor\", \"ref_ref\": \"01M0EJ9DVDA53DZBQKCAVPRH6F\", \"_ts\": 1787250349.024346, \"_n\": 2, \"_refs\": [\"decision:design/arrival-sliceC-ordering\"], \"commit\": \"3ad2933e\"}}}, \"_boundary\": {\"message\": \"session close: kyle/loops-claude\"}}","prev_hash":"c3041735d2ebbf2dc2349b728644efd6ef3f08dd3a8c62eb32daeb39cba120fc","window_start":"01M0G91SPN41VX9EAD6G3PT4PN","fact_cursor":"01M0GA3ARDVX3192KNEYZ1M9YS","window_hash":"0fd909af12e114c06a20b2d20f266da80512ced5f45ef394838db1476c51e175","signature":"UreGyd+5OfmP02JxGgzpUXUuZcO+o20hc3WTxwIrDWkQjsDv1e7ONdXaGA3PoWRK56RYL46G30lIOZWoOwguCQ=="}
